{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5vXszaT0Wxy_JJYKgHNGQg?scene=1&click_id=588294899","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:32.713695+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5vXszaT0Wxy_JJYKgHNGQg?scene=1&click_id=588294899","html":"<div><section><section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/JNwpw1lzEa3JOibnlU45mGwliabTQicGnESXdGeFgtJGBibJU6CKygfapE6FZRbW1kibibl3g9Sqsga1MicljuECcGVFQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\"/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span>上海交通大学上海高级金融学院（SAIF）</span><span>2027级</span><span>全日制金融硕士（MF）项目夏令营开放报名。</span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span><span>项目简介 SAIF MF</span></span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>上海交通大学上海高级金融学院（简称“高金/SAIF”）全日制金融硕士项目（简称“MF”）作为高金学院的旗舰项目，自2009年创立以来，始终以为金融强国与上海国际金融中心建设培养卓越人才为己任，坚持</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>专业化、国际化、市场化</span></span></span></span><span>的办学特色，拥有前沿尖端的课程设置、国际视野的教学结构、与密切深度的业界实践。 在2026年英国《金融时报》金融硕士排名中，交大高金金融硕士项目跻身</span><span><span>全球第6</span></span><span>，项目于2017年起，连续三届蝉联亚洲第一。目前，SAIF MF被视为亚洲最负盛名的金融项目之一。</span></p><section><span>项目采用两年全日制、全英文教学模式，并开设</span><span><span><span><span>金融方向（MF-General）</span>与<span>金融科技方向（MF-FinTech）</span></span></span></span><span>两大培养方向，为增进全国优秀大学生对高金金融硕士项目的了解，特于2026年7月举办夏令营活动。</span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span><span>申请条件  Who Can Apply</span></span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>1 </span></strong></em></span><span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民；</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>2 </span><span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>3 </span><span><em><strong><span><span><span><span>身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求；</span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>4 </span><span><em><strong><span><em><span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正。不存在考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果等有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为以及其他违法违纪受处分或受处罚记录；</span></span></span></span></em></span></strong></em></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>5 </span><span><em><strong><span><em><span><span><span><span><span>本科阶段学习成绩优秀，英语合格（CET6≥425或TOEFL≥90或IELTS≥6.0）；</span></span></span></span></span></em></span></strong></em></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>6 </span><span><em><strong><span><em><span><span><span><span><span>目前就读学校获得教育部推荐免试资格的优秀本科三年级在校生（2027年应届毕业生）；</span></span></span></span></span></em></span></strong></em></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>7 </span></strong></em></span><span><span><span>高金金融硕士项目设有如下两大方向，两个方向申请流程一致，<span>只可选择其一进行申请</span><span>：</span></span><span><span> </span></span></span></span></p><section><span><span>金融硕士金融方向（MF-General Track）</span>招收有较强金融知识储备、卓越领导力与沟通能力的学生，本科专业不限，欢迎经管类背景及理工科背景但希望向金融领域发展的同学报名。</span></section><section><span><span>金融硕士金融科技方向（MF-FinTech Track）</span>仅招收有很强数理和计算机背景的学生，特别是以下本科专业：数学，应用数学，统计，计算机或软件工程，金融工程，数理经济，物理，电子工程等；或经济、金融专业，辅修上述的第二专业。曾在全国中学生奥林匹克数、理、化竞赛或国际大学生数学、计算机和建模竞赛获奖的同学会更具优势。</span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span><span>申请材料 Application Materials</span></span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>1 </span></strong></em></span><span><span><span>《上海高级金融学院MF申请表》，填写完申请材料后，在系统内“申明”栏目中，选择“下载”生成申请表（仅限网页端），打印后到所在院校教务部门盖章，并在申请截止日期前上传至系统；</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><em><strong><span>2 </span><span><span><span><span>个人简历（中英文），正反面不超过一页A4纸；</span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>3 </span><span><em><strong><span><span><span><span>在线推荐信2封（中英文均可）；</span></span></span></span></strong></em></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>4 </span><span><em><strong><span><em><span><span><span><span>成绩单：申请提交截止前所能取得的最新在校成绩单（由教务部门盖章），双学位学生同时附第二学位成绩单，如有中国大陆地区以外的学习经历，也须提交相应成绩单；</span></span></span></span></em></span></strong></em></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>5 </span><span><em><strong><span><em><span><span><span><span><span>英语成绩证明；国家英语六级/托福/雅思/GRE/GMAT等考试成绩单；</span></span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></em></span></strong></em></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>6 </span><span><em><strong><span><em><span><span><span><span><span>如有相关的科研经历或研究成果，请提交扫描件；</span></span></span></span></span></em></span></strong></em></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span><em><strong><span>7 </span></strong></em></span><span><span><span>其他可以证明个人能力或经历的材料，如荣誉与奖励、各类资格证书、实践经历、创业经历、计算机水平、个人陈述、展示视频等，详情请按系统要求如实填写。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>申请方式Application Access</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JNwpw1lzEa1fSFOFKH5kTGBkhvibNeDqAtr6UxpZibJnZ95ibCDgyN8a9wy46TsHndsjuicNGD5POamjPjYdib7MOSg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\"/></section></section><section><section><p><em><span><span>扫码报名夏令营</span></span></em></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>1.请在申请系统（<span>https://apply.saif.sjtu.edu.cn/user/login/saif/42</span>）中完成注册及提交申请，参营同学须在后续登录上海交通大学研究生网申系统（ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl）进行填报，具体详情另见邮件通知。</span></section><section><span>2. 系统提交截止时间：<span>2026年7月12日</span></span></section><section><span>3. 活动举办时间：预计于7月中下旬开始，详细安排另行通知</span></section><section><span>4. 活动举办地点：上海高级金融学院·上海市徐汇区淮海西路211号</span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>其他说明Notes</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><span>1. 请详细填写并认真核对信息，尤其是邮箱及手机等联络信息；身份证号和姓名须与有效证件保持一致。</span></section><section><span>2. 填报的所有信息和提供的辅助材料必须真实有效，如弄虚作假将取消入营资格，并通报所在学校。</span></section><section><span>3. 本活动解释权归属上海交通大学上海高级金融学院金融硕士项目。</span></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ZPtdzESiawhdMHyNfDvj0a36SiaN499NjK0BKean9ibV1T8rYe2gLG8OTSjeCB1NesY09JLKujB7DqpO8DGu4HFxw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系我们</span></b></p></section><section><p><em><span>Contact us</span></em></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ht0Is7AGqwPuxCMpOeo1IygcF5k9NAQ6xMpHjHKy1ibsFHNFt6CznekXXrRpXWWEibEToNFd58p4Bh4iaibQbWTQ1j3nrNT1gfeYVYxcv9wGKgg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>021-62934968</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ht0Is7AGqwNotJwicvxAIJibR4pujBGFqFoaIUufYeaCCrArAyRcyRPRib3kibhlAxJN0OtYUwOL8RfXWhX3QiaqXlMWrSTOGq0AcLia5hnqlPym4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>mf.admissions@saif.sjtu.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业方向</span></strong></p></section><section><p><em><span>Program Tracks</span></em></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><em><span><strong><span>金融硕士金融方向（MF-General Track）：</span></strong></span></em><span>金融方向自2009年开创，课程设计框架对标美国麻省理工学院，结合国内外金融市场发展，不断对课程进行优化与改良。以经典、硬核、与时俱进著称的金融方向，覆盖财务会计、金融市场、衍生品等课程，毕业生去向包括投行与咨询、投资、投研、销售交易等方向。</span><strong><span>我们欢迎金融经管，有实习经验，中英文交流能力等软技能比较强的同学报名；金融方向也特别欢迎各类理工科，医科背景，想转金融方向的优秀人才报考。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><span><em><strong><span>金融硕士金融科技方向（MF-FinTech Track）</span></strong></em><strong><span>：</span></strong><span><span>课程设置专注于金融、机器学习和计算机技术和应用三个方面。金融科技方向 (MF-FinTech Track) 专业</span><strong><span>仅招收有很强数理和计算机背景的学生，特别是以下本科专业：数学，应用数学，统计和数据科学，自动化，计算机和人工智能，金融工程，数理经济，物理，电子工程等；经济、金融专业申请金融科技方向，需要辅修上述的专业作为第二专业或额外提供很强数理背景材料。</span></strong><span>曾在全国中学生奥林匹克数、理、计算机竞赛或国际大学生数学、计算机和建模竞赛获奖的同学会更具申请与录取优势。</span></span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>交大高金金融硕士</span></b></p></section><section><p><i><span>About SAIF MF</span></i></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>金融硕士(Master of Finance，简称 MF)是项目作为上海交通大学上海高级金融学院（交大高金/SAIF）的旗舰项目，自2009年创立以来，一直以</span><span><span><span>专业化、国际化、市场化</span></span></span><span>为办学特色，项目采用两年全日制，全英文教学模式，并直接引进世界级名校的一流师资。毕业生平均起薪连年逆势增长，就业率始终保持在100%。交大高金金融硕士项目设置<span>金融方向（MF-General）</span>与<span>金融科技方向（MF-FinTech）</span>两大培养方向，拥有前沿尖端的课程设置、国际视野的教学结构、密切深度的业界实践，与国际全面接轨。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>在</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>年英国《金融时报》金融硕士排名中，交大高金金融硕士项目跻身<span>全球第</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>，其中毕业三年后校友平均薪资位列<span>全球第</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span>；课程性价比位列<span>全球第</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span>；毕业三个月内就业率<span>保持</span></span><span><span><span>100%</span></span></span><span>；项目曾连续三届蝉联亚洲第</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>，于</span><span><span>2024</span></span><span>年起，连续三年稳居全球前</span><span><span>10</span></span><span>。目前，</span><span><span>SAIF MF</span></span><span>被视为亚洲最负盛名的金融项目之一。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JNwpw1lzEa1mOaKsbH182oMT7TOtWicZyB1b68PGQ0lDKQJYCM8FslVNTJDuJibNU9oYSmjvjacVNT1bk0wRMk5w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=9\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ZGrOHOwfWiaeuxlnMbEECPIwlKz1iaalM78vXT2Fh3l2N4s73S7YP7iamIaBXrz313RvxribES9kI6BNicNzTufqroA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=10\"/></span><span>点击“阅读原文”，了解高金MF金融硕士项目</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"09943ef8941b7a95bad0c0b025f8cbdca9f67a79fd87c237028279345dfadc05","textLength":2613,"sourceSha256":"7b807bcbaeb131503232c7d63371086b7e41a3eca0e9bae5f5091538320d1029","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f048682b315275bd2a53","title":"2026年上海交通大学上海高级金融学院2027级全日制金融硕士夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:32.713695+00:00"}
